/Title (Conclusion In this assignment, a Student Feedback Review System was successfully developed using React.js, Express.js, and MongoDB. The application enables users to submit feedback, view reviews, and analyze data through filtering and analytics features. This project demonstrates the practical implementation of the MERN stack and highlights how modern web applications are built with interactive interfaces and efficient backend systems.)
